# CV Workspace

This is a **meta-repo**. Project code lives in Git submodules under **`repos/`**, not at the workspace root.

## Submodules

- **repos/resume-data-source** — JSON resume data (`index.json`) and image assets. Deployed separately to GitHub Pages.
- **repos/portfolio** — React + Vite portfolio site. Consumes resume data from the published data source.
- **repos/cv-generator** — Markdown CV templates (`cv-md/`) and converter tooling (`converter/`).

Showcase projects (linked from `repos/resume-data-source/index.json` `projects[]`):

- **repos/rn-speed-art** — React Native design library
- **repos/react-node-template** — React + Node.js REST API monorepo template
- **repos/React-Next-Dashboard** — Next.js dashboard (BoxBook, Lab Maintenance, Stack Questions)
- **repos/Mettaton-compiler** — Robotics programming language and compiler
- **repos/Smart-house** — IoT smart home platform
- **repos/mintel** — Smart House landing page

Other projects:

- **repos/car-history-app** — Vehicle history tracking app
- **repos/groceries-app** — Groceries list app
- **repos/js-arrays-methods** — JS arrays methods reference
- **repos/screen-recorder** — Screen recorder
- **repos/arqueologIA-api** — Archaeology AI API
- **repos/greed-island-card-api** — Greed Island Card Lists API
- **repos/boda-app** — Wedding app
- **repos/NexaRize-Components** — React components made by NexaRize (tracks `dev` branch)
- **repos/nexa-components-test** — NexaRize components test app
- **repos/NexaRize-Electric-car** — Open-source electric vehicle project (Node.js + React)
- **repos/mettaton-v2** — Mettaton compiler V2

## Workflow

- Run `./scripts/update-submodules.sh` after pulling parent repo changes to sync submodules to their tracked branches.
- When submodules are updated, commit the pointer changes in the parent repo (`./scripts/update-submodules.sh --commit`).
- Make code changes inside the relevant submodule directory under `repos/`, then commit and push from that submodule's repo.
- Shared Cursor rules and scripts belong in the parent workspace root (`.cursor/`, `scripts/`).

## Data flow

```
repos/resume-data-source (index.json) → repos/portfolio (fetches published JSON)
repos/resume-data-source (index.json projects[].repo) → showcase project submodules
repos/resume-data-source (cv-md)      → repos/cv-generator (converter scripts)
```
